<title>USA: Wackenhut names Philip Maslowe CFO.</title>
<headline>Wackenhut names Philip Maslowe CFO.</headline>
<dateline>PALM BEACH GARDENS, Fla. 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wackenhut Corp said on Tuesday it has named Philip Maslowe as senior vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Since 1993, Maslowe had been executive vice president and chief financial officer of KinderCare Learning Centers Inc, Montgomery, Ala., the largest preschool and child care provider in the U.S.</p>
<p>Richard DeCook, who resigned over a year ago, was the company's previous chief financial officer, a company spokesman said.</p>
